        "text_3pC3Fj": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "100-Day Free Trial",
            "answer": "<p>Worried the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter sounds too good to be true? Not sure if it will really remove as many contaminants as we promise? We stand behind our product 100% - so you can try it at home for 100 days with our money-back guarantee. <br/><br/>If you’re not completely satisfied with the purity of your water, simply return it within 100 days for a full refund, no questions asked. <br/><br/>*T&Cs apply.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rWr6i4": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Compatibility",
            "answer": "<p>POSTreat™ Fluoride & Removal Filters are precisely designed to work in tandem with our Premium Carbon Filter Elements. Please note that they are compatible only with PF-4 Filter Elements and not with filters from other brands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_9wn3cB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Warranty",
            "answer": "<p>One Year warranty against defects in Carbon Filter Elements and workmanship. Transit damage? Report within 3 Months for free replacement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_4aC3aG": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Shipping & Returns",
            "answer": "<p><strong>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee :</strong><br/><br/>The 100-day money-back guarantee applies exclusively to filter systems purchased directly from <a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/\">https://phoenixwaterfilters.com/</a>.<br/><br/><strong>Return Process:</strong><br/><br/>To initiate a return, customers must contact our customer support team and provide valid website order details. Once verified, the support team will approve the return and provide detailed instructions on how and where to send the product.<br/><br/><strong>Important Notes:</strong><br/><br/>Products returned without prior authorization will not be accepted.<br/>Products must be returned in their original packaging and free from damage.<br/><br/><strong>Shipping:</strong><br/><br/>Most orders are processed and shipped within 3–7 business days. Thank you for your patience.<br/>We ship anywhere within the USA.<br/>Free shipping applies to retail customer orders of $99.99 or more shipped domestically.<br/>Orders are normally shipped via UPS Ground, USPS Priority Mail, or USPS First Class Mail.<br/><br/><strong>Please note: </strong>UPS does not deliver to PO Boxes or Military Addresses.<br/><br/><strong>Orders & Damaged Goods:</strong><br/><br/>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect (e.g., broken filters or wrong size), please contact Customer Service within 4 days of delivery at 1 (800) 917-0455 or <a href=\"mailto:hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com\" title=\"mailto:hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com\">hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com</a>. We will make every effort to correct your order. Phoenix Gravity will cover return shipping for any incorrect items. Please include your order ID and order date when contacting us.<br/><br/><strong>Cancellation Policy:</strong><br/><br/>Orders cannot be canceled once dispatched. Dispatched orders will be notified via the registered email address.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
