    "secondary_details_qTHLFy": {
      "type": "secondary-details",
      "custom_css": [
        "h2 {margin-top: 30px;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "heading": "Activated carbon filtration technology",
        "content": "<p><br/>Traditional filters simply trap unwanted pollutants, allowing them to accumulate and multiply where they become a breeding ground for contaminants within just two weeks - instantly contaminating any water that passes through it. To solve this crucial problem, we’ve developed activated carbon filtration technology. <br/><br/><strong>How does it work?</strong><br/><br/>First, we use granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks to remove chemicals, toxins, and heavy metals such as zinc and lead. The activated-carbon media is engineered to resist clogging and fouling so the filter keeps performing over its rated life.</p>",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": ""
      }
    },
