        "heading": "Enjoy safe, delicious drinking water every day of the year",
        "content": "<p>The Phoenix Gravity Water filtration process mimics nature and leaves oxygen and mineral contents unchanged, which gives our water a spring-like freshness and wholesome taste that’s second to none. Helping families eliminate 99.9% of harmful toxins and drink safe and delicious water all year round!</p>",
        "column_img": "shopify://shop_images/filter_bg.png",
