        "text_gLW6xT"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Engineered to last using premium quality materials",
        "content": "<p>Most filters are made from plastic, which can leach harmful chemicals into your drinking water. In contrast, we use natural kiln-fired carbon filtration from the southern province of Spain, along with granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks, to remove impurities and heavy metals like lead and zinc. All of this advanced natural filtration is housed in high-quality, food-grade AISI 304 Stainless Steel. The result is a refined, durable filtration system that delivers crisp, clean drinking water for years to come.</p>",
