    "copy_image_DfRFKh": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-light",
        "layout": "image-copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "WARNING: Drinking tap water makes 7.2 million americans sick every year!",
        "content": "<p>Every year, millions of Americans fall ill from ingesting harmful chemicals in tap water. Phoenix Gravity is designed to improve taste and reduce certain non-microbiological contaminants in municipally treated tap water. It is not a microbiological purifier.<br/><br/>These contaminants have been linked to a range of serious health issues, including liver and kidney damage, thyroid disease, cancer, and even “blue baby syndrome” in infants.<br/><br/>Phoenix Gravity Water Filters use activated carbon filtration technology to remove 99.9% of contaminants from tap water, making it safe to drink no matter where you live in the U.S.</p>",
